  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "社會創新與永續發展",
    "sub_ename": "SOCIAL INNOVATION AND SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要是希望能使學生透過對社會創新個案的探討，發現社會創新理論與實踐的辯證發展，對環境、社會與企業的永續發展所具有的重要地位，從而使學生可以獲得在永續策略規劃與執行上，展現具廣度與深度的實踐能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to lead students to find out that the dialectic development of social innovation in theory and practice is very important for sustainable development of environment, society and enterprise. Furthermore, to help students to hold wider and deeper ability in practice for the planning and fulfillment of stainable strategies.",
